  "body": "Hi,\nI'm using **Win11 25H2** (I installed it yesterday).\nI saw yesterday you released a nightly version, ie  **ART_1d40780_Win64.exe**.\nSo I uninstalled the official v. 1.25.9 which was working fine also with Win11 25H2 and I substituted it with the nightly version.\nDuring the installation it did not give any warning, but as soon as I run it, the message reported in the image below, appeared.\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"158\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6984c121-3665-4ab5-a2a3-c91466b3cf51\" />\n\nand the program could not run.\nSo I went back to v.1.25.9 and everything was working again.\n\nRegards,\nTopoldo",
